d"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 为集合。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultrafilters}(I)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ultrafilters}(I)\\)</span> (ultrafilters on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"53c6cdb1648dd0a3\" href=\"?note=53c6cdb1648dd0a3\" title=\"17-df-ultrafilters\">17-df-ultrafilters</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Regular}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{Regular}_I\\)</span> (regular-ultrafilter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6d889fd6c75f33af\" href=\"?note=6d889fd6c75f33af\" title=\"17-df-regular-ultrafilter\">17-df-regular-ultrafilter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RegularUltrafilters}(I)\">\\(\\operatorname{RegularUltrafilters}(I)\\)</span> (class defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RegularUltrafilters}(I)\n=\n\\{U\\in\\operatorname{Ultrafilters}(I):\n\\operatorname{Regular}_I(U)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RegularUltrafilters}(I)\n=\n\\{U\\in\\operatorname{Ultrafilters}(I):\n\\operatorname{Regular}_I(U)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>This atom only packages the canonical predicate as a class.  The size of a\nregularizing family is tied to the index set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6d889fd6c75f33af\" href=\"?note=6d889fd6c75f33af\" title=\"17-df-regular-ultrafilter\">17-df-regular-ultrafilter</a>, not fixed\nincorrectly to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span>.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-ultrafilters","status":"resolved","id":"53c6cdb1648dd0a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ultrafilters]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-regular-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"6d889fd6c75f33af","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-regular-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultrafilters","status":"resolved","id":"53c6cdb1648dd0a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ultrafilters}(I)$ (ultrafilters on $I$, see [[17-df-ultrafilters]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-regular-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"6d889fd6c75f33af","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Regular}_I$ (regular-ultrafilter predicate, see [[17-df-regular-ultrafilter]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-regular-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"6d889fd6c75f33af","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"This atom only packages the canonical predicate as a class.  The size of a\nregularizing family is tied to the index set $I$ by [[17-df-regular-ultrafilter]], not fixed\nincorrectly to $\\aleph_0$.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ultrafilters}(I)","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Regular}_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RegularUltrafilters}(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RegularUltrafilters}(I)\n=\n\\{U\\in\\operatorname{Ultrafilters}(I):\n\\operatorname{Regular}_I(U)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0","display":false}],"bytes":1260,"backlinks":[{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-10